<reject> The content states that _Ship of Fools_ is "The only long novel by the Pulitzer prize winning American author best known for her short stories" (referring to Katherine Anne Porter). This means it is her only long novel, not the only long novel written by someone in general, which is what the provided information suggests. </reject>

